   1 strop <version> · help · / search · q close                                                                                              ▮
   2                                                                                                                                       ▮
   3 ─ Moving ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────▮
   4    h j k l                       move (never off the line)                                                                            ▮
   5    w b e W B E                   word / WORD motions                                                                                   
   6    zz zt zb                      center/top/bottom the cursor line                                                                     
   7    H M L                         top/middle/bottom visible line                                                                        
   8    g;                            older change (changelist)                                                                             
   9    g,                            newer change (changelist)                                                                             
  10    ge gE { }                     word-end back / paragraph motions                                                                     
  11    - +                           line up / down, on the first non-blank                                                                
  12    ( )                           sentence back / forward                                                                               
  13    [( [{ ]) ]}                   the unmatched bracket before / after                                                                  
  14    g_ g0 g^ g$ gj gk             last non-blank; line start, first non-blank, end; line down / up                                      
  15    gn gN                         select the next / previous search match (cgn then . changes each)                                     
  16    0 $ G %                       line/file/pair jumps                                                                                  
  17    gg                            top of file                                                                                           
  18    enter                         line down, first non-blank (collection: open the file here; blame: the line's commit)                 
  19    tab                           jump list forward (ctrl-i)                                                                            
  20    ctrl-d ctrl-u ctrl-f ctrl-b   half/full page scroll (count = lines)                                                                 
  21    ctrl-e ctrl-y                 scroll the window one line down / up                                                                  
  22    ctrl-^                        alternate buffer                                                                                      
  23    grr                           references (LSP)                                                                                      
  24    grn                           rename the symbol under the cursor (prompts with its name)                                            
  25    gra                           actions here, as space a (code actions; Neovim's key)                                                 
  26    gri gI                        implementation (LSP)                                                                                  
  27    gy                            type definition (LSP)                                                                                 
  28    gD                            declaration (LSP)                                                                                     
  29    ]d                            next diagnostic                                                                                       
  30    [d                            previous diagnostic                                                                                   
  31    gd                            goto definition (LSP)                                                                                 
  32    gs                            switch source/header (clangd)                                                                         
  33    f<c> F<c> t<c> T<c>           find/till char (candidates light up)                                                                  
  34    ]q                            next hit of the collection (in it: from the cursor)                                                   
  35    [q                            previous hit of the collection (in it: from the cursor)                                               
  36    ]f                            next file card (collections)                                                                          
  37    [f                            previous file card (collections)                                                                      
  38    ]c                            next git hunk                                                                                         
  39    [c                            previous git hunk                                                                                     
